    {
      "id": 96034,
      "name": "Reckless",
      "username": "Reckless",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-22T00:13:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Odin\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/odin/48/2572_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Odin:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I know, couldn't remember how to spell it though so I described it (it being onomatopoeia).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I couldn't help interjecting!&nbsp; I wrote a paper on onomatopoeiae for my Modern English Grammar class my senior year of college.&nbsp; Just thought I might put my English Literature degree to some use!<br><br>I also wrote a paper on Esperanto if anyone needs to know anything about that!</p>",
